"• Double-click a thumbnail: the image opens in your viewer. Right-click: open the folder, choose another, refresh, and (with the OCR extension) read the text of the image.\n"
"• On another machine the folder may not exist: the note says so and offers to choose one.\n"
"• Read-only: the note never modifies your images."

